{"channelId":"UC1qXYv8-iKtRRh-mRwL-YGA","row":["Widom Chiropractic",4,"Here at Widom Chiropractic, we are proud to help our patients live better lives without pain.\n\nWe truly believe that nobody deserves to live in pain, even as they age, and we will do everything we can to ensure that our patients are comfortable. We are proud to help people after accidents or injuries and when they are uncomfortable doing their day-to-day activities.\n\nThough pain itself is uncomfortable, when you have chronic pain, life can become unbearable. You may struggle just doing your normal day-to-day tasks. You may have trouble concentrating because you are not feeling well.\n\nAfter a thorough examination with X-rays, we will be able to determine where your problem lies and discuss how we can help you feel better. Even after just a few treatments, you will be amazed at how much better you feel! You will be able to move around better, have better circulation, and may even start to lose weight. Chiropractic care can really make a world of difference to you!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1qXYv8-iKtRRh-mRwL-YGA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1qXYv8-iKtRRh-mRwL-YGA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:09.056Z","channelId":"UC1qXYv8-iKtRRh-mRwL-YGA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"27de85a445a60ff73aedbe24354c328dac472a90f7357ea6127b49439eda6bb7","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"09095ff029bef0a86c1e995f8a273366eb8053d1ce54739936370d3db70f2bcf"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1qXYv8-iKtRRh-mRwL-YGA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":4,"raw":"4 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1qXYv8-iKtRRh-mRwL-YGA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:09.056Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["chiropractors"],"relevantKeywords":["chiropractors"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":